{"lines":[{"c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","y":0.053779069624731557,"x":0.11728395020043644,"w":0.057613169352213556},{"c":1,"w":0.72016459147135414,"t":"The writing on the Dead Sea Scrolls is mostly in black or occasionally red ink, and","x":0.11728395930576994,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.09738372078426516},{"y":0.11336866891906239,"c":1,"x":0.11522634695979624,"t":"the scrolls themselves are nearly all made of either parchment (animal skin) or an","w":0.72016459147135414,"h":0.014538307212407231},{"w":0.75114476521809892,"c":1,"y":0.12871639639169119,"h":0.018111354751497055,"t":"early form of paper called 'papyrus'. The only exception is the scroll numbered 3Q15,","x":0.11723624746661641},{"y":0.14680232544736815,"w":0.70781890869140618,"t":"which was created out of a combination of copper and tin. Known as the Copper","c":1,"x":0.11728396122646795,"h":0.014563987898180697},{"y":0.16279069751075637,"x":0.11728394465502825,"t":"Scroll, this curious document features letters chiselled onto metal - perhaps, as some","w":0.75514404296875004,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11728395020431881,"t":"have theorized, to better withstand the passage of time. One of the most intriguing","w":0.72427983601888024,"y":0.18021201411870025,"h":0.016008916255020766},{"y":0.19611307447683268,"c":1,"t":"manuscripts from Qumran, this is a sort of ancient treasure map that lists dozens of gold","h":0.014723203769140047,"w":0.77572016398111976,"x":0.11934156400833634},{"h":0.016019188192342937,"c":1,"w":0.77572016398111987,"x":0.11728395083147916,"y":0.21366279055180137,"t":"and silver caches. Using an unconventional vocabulary and odd spelling, it describes 64"},{"x":0.11723571064673166,"y":0.22955286450775425,"t":"underground hiding places that supposedly contain riches buried for safekeeping. None","c":1,"w":0.76964960734049492,"h":0.017578595659055951},{"c":1,"w":0.74074076334635408,"h":0.014572547939556646,"t":"of these hoards have been recovered, possibly because the Romans pillaged Judea","x":0.1172839392098021,"y":0.24705535916569021},{"y":0.26295641949607096,"w":0.75514404296874982,"t":"during the first century CE. According to various hypotheses, the treasure belonged to","x":0.11728394546521344,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"h":0.019643462308023274,"t":"local people, or was rescued from the Second Temple before its destruction or never","w":0.74710052490234369,"x":0.11513998906039356,"y":0.27735533784385669,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11728395207092535,"y":0.29651162812509102,"w":0.18930040995279951,"h":0.01598837125708541,"t":"existed to begin with."},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Some of the Dead Sea Scrolls have been on interesting journeys. In 1948, a Syrian","c":1,"y":0.32979976453092141,"w":0.73251027425130211,"x":0.1172839574187006},{"x":0.1172097283625203,"w":0.75530695597330733,"h":0.019636356367239372,"y":0.34440418001493345,"c":1,"t":"Orthodox archbishop known as Mar Samuel acquired four of the original seven scrolls"},{"h":0.017349569480186178,"c":1,"x":0.11518284176879301,"w":0.72849334716796876,"t":"from a Jerusalem shoemaker and part-time antiquity dealer, paying less than $100","y":0.36182202457559032},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.11522632508992624,"w":0.74691360473632806,"c":1,"t":"for them. He then travelled to the United States and unsuccessfully offered them to a","y":0.37926972888183696},{"c":1,"x":0.11728394638056869,"y":0.39534883704790036,"w":0.74897120157877595,"t":"number of universities, including Yale. Finally, in 1954, he placed an advertisement in","h":0.017489796673310853},{"x":0.11522633231766577,"t":"the business newspaper The Wall Street Journal - under the category 'Miscellaneous","y":0.41279069754151076,"w":0.75514404296875004,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"y":0.42873969376805787,"h":0.016027748233718775,"x":0.11522633860702532,"t":"Items for Sale' - that read: 'Biblical Manuscripts dating back to at least 200 B.C. are for","w":0.76954732259114578,"c":1},{"x":0.11522632949931866,"y":0.44611307447725346,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140047,"t":"sale. This would be an ideal gift to an educational or religious institution by an individual","w":0.77366256713867188},{"x":0.1152263498866707,"y":0.46075581367657514,"t":"or group.' Fortunately, Israeli archaeologist and statesman Yigael Yadin negotiated their","w":0.77366251627604166,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"t":"purchase and brought the scrolls back to Jerusalem, where they remain to this day.","w":0.73456792195638021,"x":0.11728394015508485,"y":0.47965116264455354,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"y":0.51148409914645399,"t":"In 2017, researchers from the University of Haifa restored and deciphered one of the last","h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.78600824991861984,"x":0.11522632760922438},{"t":"untranslated scrolls. The university's Eshbal Ratson and Jonathan Ben-Dov spent one","x":0.11728396181448658,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.75925923665364592,"y":0.52906976730910771},{"t":"year reassembling the 60 fragments that make up the scroll. Deciphered from a band","y":0.54505300370069509,"x":0.1152263414492693,"h":0.01599350806821509,"w":0.75102879842122383,"c":1},{"x":0.11522635358062872,"y":0.56095406384847757,"t":"of coded text on parchment, the find provides insight into the community of people who","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"w":0.76748967488606767},{"x":0.11522634673399096,"c":1,"h":0.016034596379148613,"w":0.77160491943359366,"y":0.57848837194492986,"t":"wrote it and the 364-day calendar they would have used. The scroll names celebrations"},{"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"that indicate shifts in seasons and details two yearly religious events known from","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.59593023243860377,"c":1,"x":0.11728394391704645},{"c":1,"t":"another Dead Sea Scroll. Only one more known scroll remains untranslated.","w":0.67283950805664061,"h":0.016010628150966877,"x":0.11728394957617705,"y":0.61189634873430032},{"y":0.86773255796252025,"w":0.024691357612609849,"x":0.11728395071109127,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"38"},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.66991094639740412,"w":0.30613845825195307,"h":0.033792529426278195,"y":0.95311055968589831,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3395}